1 & \text{if manager } i \text{ is assigned to project } j \\
0 & \text{otherwise}
\end{cases}
\]
for all \( i \in M, j \in P \).

Objective:
\[
\min \sum_{i=1}^{11} \sum_{j=1}^{11} c_{ij} x_{ij}
\]

